# ✅ Work Completed So Far

## 1. Created a Separate DevOps Repository

A separate repository was created specifically for the DevOps implementation.

This allows DevOps experiments, Docker configurations, deployment files, CI/CD workflows, infrastructure configurations, and other operational changes to be developed without affecting the original working MERN project.

### Repositories

| Repository                  | Purpose                             |
| --------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |
| `eddytiya/jerseyhub`        | Original JerseyHub MERN application |
| `eddytiya/jerseyhub-devops` | DevOps implementation               |
| `main`                      | Primary branch                      |

The existing Git history was preserved while connecting the DevOps copy to the new GitHub repository.

### Commands Used

```powershell
git remote set-url origin https://github.com/eddytiya/jerseyhub-devops.git
git push -u origin main
```

This provides a dedicated environment where the DevOps implementation can evolve independently from the original application.

